#: rc.cpp:649
msgid ""
"When Krita uses projections, the results of group layers, effect masks and "
"adjustment layers are cached. This takes a lot of memory but speeds up "
"processing considerably."
msgstr ""
"Cando Krita emprega proxección o resulado da agrupación de capas, máscaras "
"de efecto e os axustes de capas recurren ó caché. Isto emprega moita memoria "
"mais aumenta o procesado considerablemente. "

